@startuml design-flow

' ============================================================
' 状态机：LoanOrder 订单状态流转
' 来源：design.md §"状态流与边界情况" + §"数据流（主流程）"
' 状态集：draft / pending / approved / rejected / active / closed
' 终态：rejected、closed
' ============================================================

state draft
state pending
state approved
state rejected
state active
state closed

[*] --> draft

draft --> pending : submit\n(POST /loans/:id/submit)
pending --> approved : 自动审批通过\n(CreditService.approve, score ≥ threshold)
pending --> rejected : 自动审批拒绝\n(CreditService.approve, score < threshold,\n写 decision_reason)
approved --> active : sign\n(POST /loans/:id/sign)
active --> closed : complete\n(POST /loans/:id/complete,\n写 order_log action+comment)

rejected --> [*] : 终态（不可回流 pending）
closed --> [*] : 终态

note right of draft
  起始点，未提交不入审批
  来源：design.md §"状态流与边界情况"
end note

note right of pending
  自动审批即生效，
  无操作员人工通过/驳回环节
  来源：design.md §"数据流（主流程）3" + §"范围外"
end note

note left of rejected
  终态，不可回流 pending
  来源：design.md §"状态流与边界情况"
end note

note left of active
  签署后进入 active；
  完成处理后转 closed
  来源：design.md §"数据流（主流程）4-5"
end note

note right of pending
  非法流转（如 pending→closed、
  rejected→pending）由 service 层
  状态机校验拒绝
  来源：design.md §"状态流与边界情况"
  + US-007/AC-011
end note


@enduml